The GitLab CI Pipeline Flow

Developer pushes code to GitLab
        ↓
GitLab Runner picks up the job
        ↓
Pulls maven image (Java + Maven)
        ↓
Spins up SQL Server 2022 as a sidecar container
        ↓
mvn dependency:go-offline   ← downloads all dependencies
        ↓
mvn test                    ← runs all 13 tests
  │
  ├── DatabaseSetup connects to SQL Server
  ├── Creates TestDB database
  ├── Runs DDL scripts (tables + stored procedures)
  └── Runs 13 JUnit tests
        ↓
mvn surefire-report:report-only   ← generates HTML report
        ↓
Artifacts saved to GitLab:
  ├── target/surefire-reports/TEST-*.xml  ← visible in Tests tab
  └── target/reports/surefire.html        ← downloadable HTML report
        ↓
SQL Server container destroyed

